1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,428
Today
今天

2
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:02,306
our family of three went to the beach
我们一家三口去海边了

3
00:00:02,307 --> 00:00:03,387
The sun was bright
阳光明媚

4
00:00:03,387 --> 00:00:04,751
and the sand was warm
沙子很温暖

5
00:00:05,187 --> 00:00:07,551
My dad and I built a big sandcastle
我爸爸和我建了一个大沙堡

6
00:00:07,828 --> 00:00:09,067
Mom read a book nearby
妈妈在旁边看书

7
00:00:09,067 --> 00:00:09,220
Then
然后呢

8
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,666
we swam together in the cool sea
我们一起在凉爽的海里游泳

9
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:11,827
We also ate ice cream
我们还吃了冰淇淋

10
00:00:11,827 --> 00:00:12,990
which tasted great
味道很棒。

11
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:14,307
It was a wonderful day
那是美好的一天

12
00:00:14,307 --> 00:00:16,242
and we were all very happy
我们都很开心

